NetHack 3.0 Patchlevel 8 was just submitted to comp.sources.games
for release.  It will probably be posted in a couple of days.  A
few days later, Bill Randle will re-post the complete 3.0 (Pl8) 
source.

This patch is the last scheduled official patch for NetHack 3.0.
The Development Team moves now to work on NetHack 3.1.

We ask you to continue mailing us bug reports.  For one thing, 
most if not all of them will apply also to 3.1.  For another, if
more fatal bugs are found, we may release bugfixes as a stop-gap
Patchlevel 9.

Once Pl8 appears on comp.sources.games, a notice about the 
availability of Pl8 3.0 binaries will be posted on this and other
appropriate newsgroups by the porting teams.

We wish to congratulate and thank all of you.  NetHack 3.0 could 
not have been developed without your enthusiastic help and moral
support.

